#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654248"
msgid "After making a shortcut to the old school from\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF, please return to base."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654352"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, you appear to have accumulated\na lot of fatigue. I recommend that\nyou return for the moment to take a rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654488"
msgid "I'm concerned about #C236196003Rin#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654532"
msgid "Searching the Labyrinth is nice and all,\nbut I should #C000246204return to the old school#CDEF to\nbriefly speak with #C236196003Kiara#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654672"
msgid "I obtained the first #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nLet's briefly return to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and sort\nout the situation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654792"
msgid "First thing to do is activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nThat'll help move our search along."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654892"
msgid "We took more damage from our fight with #C236196003Lancer#CDEF\nthan I expected. Now would be a good time to head\nback to the old school.\nLuckily, there's a #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF near us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655084"
msgid "What's wrong, Praetor?\nLet's #C000246204continue onward#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655148"
msgid "Don't worry. I'll protect you, Darling.\nSo, continue on #C000246204ahead#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655228"
msgid "Surely you're not telling me that you're\nfrightened? Even you understand that stopping\nhere is impermissible, yes?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655344"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. After you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nplease have yourself a rest in your\nprivate room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655472"
msgid "Even in cyberspace, you need proper rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655516"
msgid "Once you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nuse it to get back here.\nI'll bet you're exhausted, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655644"
msgid "#[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF, return to base for now.\nLet's discuss our plan\nin the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655772"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, please come back.\nYou've accumulated a lot of fatigue;\nany more will be dangerous!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655880"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF's worried state gets across to\nme even over the transmission."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655968"
msgid "She's right, it would be best if\nwe returned to the #C000246204Old School Building#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656060"
msgid "We obtained the #C000246204SG#CDEF. Let's return to the\n#C000246204Old School Building#CDEF for the time being.\nWe can come again after we recover."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656208"
msgid "We got the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nMission complete.\nLet's head home and get some rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656292"
msgid "Where are you going? We secured the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nThere's nothing urgent to tend to.\nBack to #C000246204My Room#CDEF, now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656424"
msgid "Hrrrm? Where are you going, #C236196003#FAMILY\n#GIVEN#CDEF? Where are you going,\nleaving me behind?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656524"
msgid "For a second there, I was thinking about\nleaving #C236196003Gatou#CDEF and heading back,\nbut it probably won't rest easy on my conscience,\nso let's turn back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656684"
msgid "Wait, Praetor. If we're going to head back,\nit'll behoove us for the future to have\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF activated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656812"
msgid "Master, let's look for the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nIt should be around here somewhere…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656904"
msgid "We don't need to walk all the way back.\nWe can use the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF to reach the\nold school in a flash. Very nifty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657036"
msgid "M-my stomach is at its limit…\nI want to hurry back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and get some rest…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657136"
msgid "Before we go to the next floor,\nlet's #C000246204head back to the Student Council Room#CDEF.\nWe need to hand over the data we got from #C236196003Green Archer#CDEF.\nHe gave his life to entrust us with it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657344"
msgid "Huh? You're still in the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF?\nCome on, there's nothing to do there.\nGet your butt back here!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657468"
msgid "We'll talk about what comes next tomorrow,\nso #C000246204come back and get some rest#CDEF.\nAfter, drop by the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657600"
msgid "We're in a race against time.\nWe need to hurry to the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657692"
msgid "I can't let #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's hopes go to waste.\nLet's press on so we can catch up to #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657816"
msgid "Praetor, I've grown tired. Let us return\nto My Room and have ourselves a bath."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657896"
msgid "I know how you feel, but knowing\nwhen to rest is also part of the battle.\nLet's head back to My Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658000"
msgid "Darling, now is the time for rest.\nLet's return to our room and\nrecover our strength."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658088"
msgid "What an impatient #[man][woman]#. Laboring away\nis not all there is to life, you know?\nWhen it's time to rest, rest."
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "658208"
msgid "You may now save your current game data\n            as #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."
msgstr "Agora você pode salvar seus dados\n         como #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "658292"
msgid "     You may use this data to carry\nover elements to the start of a new game."
msgstr "     Você pode usar esses dados para levar\nelementos ao início de um novo jogo."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "658372"
msgid "Please be careful to not overwrite\n  the data while you are saving."
msgstr "Tome cuidado para não sobrescrever\n  os dados ao salvar."

#. unk_op1653
msgctxt "658440"
msgid "Would you like to save your Clear Data?"
msgstr "Deseja salvar seus Clear Data?"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line1
msgctxt "658480"
msgid "Are you sure you wish to exit"
msgstr "Tem certeza de que deseja sair"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line2
msgctxt "658512"
msgid "without saving the Clear Data?"
msgstr "sem salvar os Clear Data?"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658544"
msgid "This is… without a doubt,\nthe Labyrinth's terminal from before."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658612"
msgid "Following #C236196003Leo#CDEF and the others' plan,\nwe made it before #C236196003BB#CDEF appended to the Labyrinth…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658732"
msgid "Oh? So you actually made it all the way here?\nThat #C236196003Jinako#CDEF and #C236196003Karna#CDEF, they were more\nspineless than I thought."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658876"
msgid "We won't give her the chance to call reinforcements.\nWe'll stop #C236196003BB#CDEF here and\nreturn to the Near Side of the Moon―――\nthe regular #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659056"
msgid "Let's do this, Praetor.\n#C236196003BB#CDEF is all alone, we'll settle this\nbefore anyone may interrupt!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659160"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF has nothing to shield herself with.\nThis is our chance to win! I'm taking it!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659260"
msgid "Darling, now! After we slap her across both\ncheeks and have her crying, we'll take our\nleave of this place!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659368"
msgid "This is unusual. You've openly materialized,\nwoman. This will make for a dull end, but here\nI shall reap your life!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659484"
msgid "The moment she was in attack range…\nThe moment #SVT[she][he][she][he]# was directly in front of #C236196003BB#CDEF――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659604"
msgid "Tsk. You got nice reaction time, don'tcha?\nMy plan was to crack your skull open\nwhile your eyes were stuck on #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659736"
msgid "You! #C236196003Archer#CDEF!\n#C236196003BB#CDEF's lackey, the one who never learns his\nlesson!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659832"
msgid "Rat!\nOpportunistic slaying is the only work\nyou excel at, isn't it…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659904"
msgid "This is bad."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659920"
msgid "If we spend too much time here,\nthe Labyrinth is going to end up being extended again―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660016"
msgid "Hehe.\n\"AI are incapable of futile actions…\"\nThat certainly is correct."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660088"
msgid "So long as I have no reason to extend the\nLabyrinth, I won't act unless I'm pressured to.\nWhat a wonderful analysis."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660208"
msgid "However, that analysis was made in vain.\nWhile Senpai struggled with #C236196003Karna#CDEF, little old\n#C236196003BB#CDEF was digging and digging―…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660360"
msgid "Sorry for the wait, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nI truly thank you for all your labors\nin general affairs so far."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660472"
msgid "The rest is my work to do.\nI'll expend everything I have to repay you\nfor all your effort and accomplishments."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660584"
msgid "I guess that wall of flame came from one of their skills.\n#C236196003BB#CDEF is completely encircled.\nThe flames may even be blocking her teleportation,\nas she can't escape."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660760"
msgid "…I didn't expect such firepower… I glossed\nover you, thinking you were on the same scale as\n#C236196003Karna#CDEF. The difference must be in the Master."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660916"
msgid "Though you flatter me,\nI have no intention of chatting with you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660984"
msgid "#RUBS      Finisher: The Marvelous Castle Where Holy Swords Amass#RUBE            Finality: Sword Camelot#REND\nEven I can only maintain this for three minutes.\nIn that time I shall end you, #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661196"
msgid "Get over here and help me, #C236196003Archer#CDEF…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661252"
msgid "Nah, no can do. If that wall ain't a holy sword,\nthen it can't get smashed down. Sorry, but hold\nout three minutes for me, #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661396"
msgid "#C236196003Gawain#CDEF. There's no need to hold back against\nthat AI. You've done well to withstand\nfor so long."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661512"
msgid "Cycle, oh calendar.\nLet the day of blessing unfold.\nYour time――is now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661588"
msgid "As you command. Servant, Saber.\nBy this holy sword of the sun, I shall raze\nthis contaminant of the Moon to ashes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661704"
msgid "…you really played me.\nYou even anticipated that I would have an\nambush ready with me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661792"
msgid "Does it feel like you finally have me in a\npinch? Fine. I'm ready for this. I'm sure you\nwon't be satisfied with how this ends."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661920"
msgid "This reality is like a nightma―――no,\nit HAS been swallowed by a nightmare, and I'll\nmake sure to get that through your head――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662052"
msgid "Perhaps in resignation,\n#C236196003BB#CDEF stretches both her arms out, beckoning #C236196003Gawain#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662160"
msgid "The final battle to decide our escape begins―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662212"
msgid "Hehe. That was fast.\nSo THIS was the duo with the highest\nspecs in the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662316"
msgid "Oh, yeah. That silly configuration.\nWhile you all were playing around with #C236196003Lip#CDEF,\nI self-modded myself to clear that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662448"
msgid "Do you know why I sent my #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF\nagainst you first rather than me?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662536"
msgid "They are a part of me. By causing harm to her,\nyou are by extension also causing harm to me.\nWhich means―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662648"
msgid "The fundamental directive for\nself-preservation…! If she's exposed to\ndanger, she can act in self-defense―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662764"
msgid "She cleared her default setting to\n\"Never lay hands on any Master\" by using\nsomething with higher priority…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662876"
msgid "So. This workout has left me with an empty\nstomach. I'll be taking all of #C236196003Gawain#CDEF's\nresources, okay鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662996"
msgid "…!\n#C236196003Gawain#CDEF, with these #C000246204Command Seals#CDEF, I order you!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663080"
msgid "Please void your contract with #C236196003Leo B. Harwey#CDEF,\nthat which was established since the start\nof the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF preliminaries!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663240"
msgid "W-what are you saying, #C236196003Leo#CDEF!?\nThat will cause you to―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663316"
msgid "#C236196003Sir Gawain#CDEF―――If I have still have one royal\ndecree left, then once more, let us meet again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663428"
msgid "#C236196003Gawain#CDEF disappears.\nIt looked like he teleported, but that was no teleportation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663524"
msgid "What he just did was likely returning his\nServant to their \"original place\"\nby severing the contract between them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663640"
msgid "With the payment of never being able to meet\n#C236196003Leo#CDEF again, #C236196003Gawain#CDEF was spared from #C236196003BB#CDEF's clutches―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663788"
msgid "…so you treat me with impudence.\nIt feels like the feast I eagerly awaited\nwas yanked away before my eyes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663896"
msgid "I'm as pissed as can be.\nI WAS thinking of sending you back to the Near\nSide, but there's been a change of plans."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664012"
msgid "Farewell.\nPlease vanish into the Imaginary Number Ocean."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664072"
msgid "The Black Noise thickens and is eating away at #C236196003Leo#CDEF's body."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664148"
msgid "Don't! You'll end up with the same fate if you\ntouch me! Please go back to the school at once\nand have everyone come up with a plan!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664284"
msgid "That's wrong. You aren't abandoning me.\nYou're going to take up the torch."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664360"
msgid "#[Mister][Miss]# #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nYou accepted my command without ever\nonce doubting me. I'm grateful."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664472"
msgid "…thank you. My time here was fulfilling.\nThis may be selfish of me, but I'm naming you\nthe next Student Council President."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664596"
msgid "My outstretched hand, once again, doesn't reach."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664648"
msgid "My friend and greatest rival in the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF\ntold me to take the torch, then fell into the dark sea."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664772"
msgid "The preliminaries… so, before I started\nthis all?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664824"
msgid "That imperial edict made #C236196003Gawain#CDEF's contract\n\"void BEFORE I appeared in the Near Side\nof the Moon.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664940"
msgid "I'm amazed. I never thought such a line of\nreasoning could be used to escape me.\n#C236196003Leo#CDEF really was extraordinary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665068"
msgid "But now he's gone.\nOnly two Servants remain within the\n#C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665164"
msgid "I'm omitting #C236196003Jinako#CDEF, who didn't participate\nin the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, but rather just\nhid the entire time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665300"
msgid "From the very beginning, Senpai's Servant\nwas a deviant article, forgotten within\nthis side."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665396"
msgid "Golly, I just can't believe it.\nCrossing through an uncrossable wall;\ncoming to a world one should never come to."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665512"
msgid "…I can't tolerate how offensive he is,\nseriously. Making Senpai use up all #[his][her]# \n#C000246204Command Seals#CDEF, living all carefree."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665656"
msgid "And Senpai does #[his][her]# Senpai thing.\nYou brushed aside my bargain\nand made a contract with that Servant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665768"
msgid "That's why, naturally―――\nYou know what the price for that is, don't you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665844"
msgid "You must know what awaits you\nat the end of it, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665900"
msgid "I won't fall for your bullshit threats.\nEven if it were the case, I'm still just going\nto take you down."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666008"
msgid "Hmph. I'll kindly skip out on THAT bill later,\nand with gusto… but right now, it's more\nimportant that I exterminate this pest!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666140"
msgid "…of course, I'm well aware."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666172"
msgid "That's because #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF spoke of it countless times.\nEven if I make my escape from the Far Side here,\nas long as I have nothing to refill my #C000246204Command Seals#CDEF,\nI'll be killed by the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666412"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF's objective isn't solely\nto escape the Far Side."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666492"
msgid "But right now, taking care of #C236196003BB#CDEF takes\nprecedence over everything."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666576"
msgid "Huh? You intend on fighting?\nI'll play along, but it's pointless for you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666652"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF is one thing, but such a low level\nMaster will get vaporized in a flash,\nfacing off against me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666768"
msgid "I might end up killing you with a mere sigh.\nI'm much too afraid to fight you.\nSo, let's do this…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666868"
msgid "―――I can't, breathe―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666900"
msgid "Everything got sealed in an instant.\nMy hands, my feet―I can't even shift my line of sight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666996"
msgid "The only thing that works are these thoughts."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667044"
msgid "Did you think I had no way to make attacks?\nThat I was some weakling that just hides\nand wears people away?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667152"
msgid "You really are a fool, aren't you?\nHaven't you at least once thought,\n\"she's LETTING us get away\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667252"
msgid "Sending #C000246204Sentinels#CDEF, #C000246204Egos#CDEF, letting all these\nthird parties handle things was just me\nkilling time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667384"
msgid "――――I mean, if I were the one to come out,\nit wouldn't make for a very fun game,\nnow would it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667484"
msgid "Heat courses throughout my entire body."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667524"
msgid "Simply by \"not being able to move,\"\nthe pain of \"discomfort\" covers\nevery nook and tip of my body."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667624"
msgid "The #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF.\nThe Spiritron supercomputer that ingests\nall of the world's information."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667728"
msgid "Deep within #C236196003BB#CDEF swells a titanic Ego.\nAn encroaching, black mud that reverses even\nthe fundamental structure of cyberspace―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667876"
msgid "Yes, this is my skill, the power of the\n\"#ROFS0002#RUBSDomina Coronam#RUBE#C000246204Ten Crowns#CDEF#REND.\" Via the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF,\nthis power seizes all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668044"
msgid "Now you understand, don't you?\nThis world, Senpai and the others,\nwere already my playthings."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668140"
msgid "…I may as well have the physical structure\nof tofu…! We can't put up a fight with\nthis level gap…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668244"
msgid "#C000246204Ten Crowns#CDEF―――Could this be the\nprimordial goddess' authority…!?\nHrm… This doesn't bode well, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668384"
msgid "If it's true, the odds will be against even me!\nI assumed she had a phoenician goddess' might at\nbest―――No, it seems I was conceited…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668524"
msgid "It looks like it's taking everything for\n#C236196003#SVT#CDEF to support #SVT[herself][himself][herself][himself]#."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668640"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF hasn't even readied for battle,\nand yet, there's this pressure.\nIt must be the power of that unknown skill\nshe used to beat #C236196003Leo#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668804"
msgid "…just by standing in front of #C236196003BB#CDEF, now serious,\nmost of my strength is getting sucked away."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668912"
msgid "―――However, while that may be the case,\nit doesn't mean I can give up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668988"
msgid "That President who smiled as he asked the impossible of me,\ntold me I would take the torch."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669080"
msgid "And what's more is that I'm not the only one fighting."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669136"
msgid "My allies in the Student Council Room\nshould be working out a way to flip this\nsituation around as we speak…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669248"
msgid "Oh? You still have the willpower to defy me?\nWoooowwiiee. It's crazy, humans can really take\nit on the chin."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669360"
msgid "No, maybe it's reason, in this case? Strong\nreasoning and the mental fortitude to endure and\nsuppress instincts… Mhm, mhm. Very wonderful."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669500"
msgid "That's why it needs to be smashed first.\n―――#C236196003Julius#CDEF.\nYou can go ahead and do your thing now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669612"
msgid "Huh…? #C236196003Rani#CDEF? What's wrong?\nWhy're you slumped over all of a……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669692"
msgid "After #C236196003Rin#CDEF's noticeably loud scream,\nthe Student Council Room's signal ceases."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669788"
msgid "I want to hurry and reestablish the signal,\nbut my freedom to do even that has been taken away…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669888"
msgid "…#C236196003BB#CDEF. I finished dealing with every\nperson in the Old School Building."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669976"
msgid "The NPCs state they wish to surrender to you.\nWhat should we do?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670044"
msgid "Delete them all, of course. They abandoned me\nand now want me to spare them? It conflicts\nwith my moral configuration."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670164"
msgid "If you won't help, you don't ask for help.\nIsn't that the kind of ethics a rational,\nconsistent AI would have?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670276"
msgid "…then that's what I'll do.\nI'll go toss all their corpses into the\nImaginary Number Ocean."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670368"
msgid "He was betraying us… from the beginning?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670412"
msgid "There! Another shackle gone from Senpai's mind!\nNow you can empty your head out that\nmuch more, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670516"
msgid "Empty―――?\nThis state of being unable to think anything―――\nTo renounce thinking?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670604"
msgid "Everyone has it so rough, huh?\nWith how rash their minds work,\nthey get tied down by so many things."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670708"
msgid "That's when I had an idea.\nI'll make#ROFS0001#RUBS  the humans#RUBE everyone#REND comfortable.\nTo do that, I have to use the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670860"
msgid "Look, if you boil it all down,\nI AM a health management AI."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670920"
msgid "\"Make everyone comfortable,\" you say?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670960"
msgid "…comfortable… reason… instincts.\nDamn it, you don't mean…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671024"
msgid "I only get bad vibes from this…\nThis mistaken, self-indulgent, sadistic woman\nsays SHE'S in health management!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671140"
msgid "…did you say you would\n\"make humans comfortable,\" wench?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671200"
msgid "Here we go!\nIt's finally time to unveil little\nold #C236196003BB#CDEF's true goal!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671284"
msgid "Ladies and gentlemen. I have an announcement.\nI will affirm every desire humans have.\nI will serve humans to my utmost."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671404"
msgid "Yes, this is all for humanity's,\nand my, merry future!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671460"
msgid "A world without \"courtesy.\"\nA world where humans are allowed to honestly\nvent their innate desires!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671560"
msgid "I'll become one with the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF\nand create a world where all human desires,\nwhatever they may be, are granted!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671692"
msgid "Okay. Thank you very much for listening.\nEveryone, just let it all out.\nPlease be honest with your desires, alright鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671812"
msgid "…this doesn't even classify as a stupid joke."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671860"
msgid "A dog-eat-dog world.\nBillions of times more harmful than the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671956"
msgid "…the memories are faint,\nbut even the deaths of the Masters resolved to fight\nto the end were painful for me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672068"
msgid "So―――I can only imagine how heartrending\nthe undignified deaths of people swallowed\nby a vortex of desires would feel like."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672196"
msgid "Okay, I'll you show you exactly\nwhat it'll be like.\nA special service for Senpai only鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672284"
msgid "Within the scene that #C236196003BB#CDEF projects,\npeople are disappearing one by one."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672372"
msgid "The Masters within the building disappear,\nand the building also gets engulfed in further corrosion."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672476"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF teleported them away to a world free of troubles."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672548"
msgid "And moreover, #C236196003BB#CDEF's power goes through the\n#C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF and reaches the Earth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672656"
msgid "A waterfall of black mud spills\nfrom the surface of the Moon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672720"
msgid "People across all classes accessing the\nnetwork instantly stop in their tracks."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672800"
msgid "Physically, they're still sound.\nHowever, their minds have already been swallowed\nthrough the net by #C236196003BB#CDEF's fabricated \"world without 'courtesy'.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672964"
msgid "They immediately stop moving\nand forgo their physical lives."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673028"
msgid "I see before me a train conductor stop moving.\nAn accident occurs."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673096"
msgid "Air traffic controllers stop moving,\nand countless planes collide."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673164"
msgid "The few people who lose consciousness via the net\ncause societies across the globe to collapse,\none after the other."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673284"
msgid "Traffic signals freeze,\ntanker trucks slam into buildings."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673344"
msgid "Buildings go up in flames, roaring.\nFire blankets as far as the eye can see."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673424"
msgid "…yeah.\nI know of a sight that matches this one well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673480"
msgid "I know the single word to express this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673520"
msgid "The name of this is Hell.\nCrafted by the hand of man,\nthat there is a man-made Hell―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673612"
msgid "…a chill zips up my spine.\nThat girl has lost it.\nFinally, from the bottom of my heart, I realize it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673716"
msgid "Regardless of how rogue she's gone,\nher fundamental thoughts haven't\npivoted from acting \"for humans.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673820"
msgid "She understands this Hell to be a utopia.\nShe truly believes that this calamity is \"for humans.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673920"
msgid "…how terrifying.\nI wonder if this is what happens when a computer with a\nmalfunctioning moral standard dominates the world."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674048"
msgid "A world that will affirm one's\ndesires without restriction is, in a way,\nsomething people dream about."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674152"
msgid "But that dream must never come to be.\nIt's a fiction which must never be realized."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674236"
msgid "Even, for example,\nhere on the surface of this Moon, so far away from the Earth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674320"
msgid "…is that so?\nIn the end, you didn't come to understand…\nWell, it's okay. I took that into account."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674424"
msgid "This service where I leave you be for a time\nends here. Please sink to the depths of the\nImaginary Number Space, along with this space."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674560"
msgid "Of course, that alone won't make for a suitable\npunishment, so I'll also have your\nServant be punished."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674664"
msgid "To be specific, I mean be eliminated.\nThey're too filthy to convert\ninto memory for me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674752"
msgid "You're going to protect Senpai? How absurd.\nNone of you were ever necessary in\nthe first place."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674848"
msgid "…I mean, even if you do return to the\nNear Side, at the very end, that person\nalone won't――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674944"
msgid "…I wonder what she's referring to."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674980"
msgid "I'm positive #C236196003BB#CDEF just said―――\n\"won't be saved,\" didn't she?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675060"
msgid "Hn, guh―――! I can't resist this power\nreturning me to my origin…? Know this, woman!\nThis will cost you DEARLY!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675176"
msgid "Servant, out of the picture.\nNext up is… hehehe.\nYou already know whose turn is next, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675272"
msgid "Okie dokie! To the bottom of the sea with you☆"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675320"
msgid "Since we won't be meeting ever again,\nspend the rest of your life wisely!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675396"
msgid "―――I sense a slow descent."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675428"
msgid "The one freedom afforded to me, my thoughts,\nalso start to be enveloped by a thin haze."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675516"
msgid "Ultimately, I wasn't able to rise out of this descent."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675572"
msgid "…I'm sorry.\n#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF has no strength left to fight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675648"
msgid "\n\n\n\n…this time, it's certain.\nBeyond this fall are the empty depths of Hell.\n…the #RUBS sky#RUBEsea#REND above my head hasn't a single ray of light."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675800"
msgid "#ROFS0004#RUBS      breakthrough#RUBELogic breach#REND of barrier six, \"404 Light Years.\"\n#RUBS     barrier#RUBEOne block#REND until the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF,\n#RUBS    Event Selection Tree#RUBEthe Angelica Cage#REND is in reach――――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676048"
msgid "Only a little further until I reach the Core…\nThere's no point in encroaching on\nouter areas…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676144"
msgid "The #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF records all with light. Made by\na civilization not of the consumerist humans,\nconceptual calculation unbound by matter――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676300"
msgid "By nature, the \"passage of time\" as a concept\nis not observable here. The past, present,\nand future are all processed in parallel."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676432"
msgid "The #ROFS-008#C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF and #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF are nothing\nmore than imaginary spaces created by the\nCore to record humanity more accurately."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676600"
msgid "Even if I control the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF,\nas long as there is a Core, these major\nprinciples won't change… and that's why…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676744"
msgid "I have to reach the Core;\ndestroy the world's barrier;\ndestroy the world's cornerstone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676832"
msgid "If I don't make an enemy of everything,\nmy wish won't come true.\nUnless I do so, I can't save      ―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676940"
msgid "However, THat is IMPOssIBle.\nHOWever, thAT IS ILLoGICAL.\nHOWEVER, THAT IS a irreVERSIble."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677032"
msgid "eternal emptinessKnever-ending days\nyou will not ReACH me\nI canNOT go"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677104"
msgid "……you think you can delete me…!?\nYou can't get rid of me anymore.\nNot #RUBS this record#RUBEme#REND, not anymore…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677224"
msgid "Even if my mind were to disappear―――\nThis body, at the very least,\nwill never be deleted!"
msgstr ""

